  - type: software
    title: "pysam"
    authors:
      - name: "pysam-developers"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/pysam-developers/pysam"
    notes: >-
      Per-read codon extraction for SNP profiling (EXTRACT_CODON_FREQS). Per the pysam project: "pysam
      has not been published in print. When referring to pysam, please use the GitHub URL
      https://github.com/pysam-developers/pysam. As pysam is a wrapper around htslib and the samtools
      package, I suggest citing Li et al. (2009), Bonfield et al. (2021), and/or Danecek et al. (2021),
      as appropriate." The Danecek et al. (2021) SAMtools/BCFtools reference is already listed above in
      this file; the Li (2009) SAM format paper and Bonfield (2021) HTSlib paper are not yet added here.

